<title>HONG KONG: Stone Electronic 1996 net rises 76 pct.</title>
<headline>Stone Electronic 1996 net rises 76 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.01     vs 2.84</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.37    vs 17.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,509.99 vs 1,595.93</p>
<p>    Company name		 Stone Electronic Technology Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 10-16</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Stone Electronic Technology makes integrated word processors, fluorescent electronic ballasts and industrial controllers in China.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is two H.K. cents vs 1.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
